  "solution": {
    "text": "Acceleration of the suitcase till the slipping continues is<br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#8203;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Slipping will continue until its velocity also becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br />or or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br />In this time, the displacement of the suitcase<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0.6</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br />and the displacement of the belt,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.8</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br />Displacement of the suitcase with respect to the belt<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>"
